  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb",
    "Can be used transitively (parar el coche = to stop the car) or intransitively (el coche para = the car stops)",
    "\"Pararse\" (reflexive) is also common: me paro = I stop (myself)",
    "Past participle: parado",
    "\"Parado\" also means unemployed in Spain: estar parado = to be unemployed",
    "Common with \"de\": parar de llover = to stop raining"
  ],
